 * Spiral Growth Trajectory: The accumulation of experience and understanding is not linear but spiral-shaped. The optimal life path is a continuous curved trajectory (an "optimal trajectory") guided by emotion, meaning, and resonance. The growth of consciousness can be summarized along four axes of this spiral:
