<h2 data-start="2748" data-end="2802">3. Curvature of Affect and RSVP Spacetime Curvature</h2>
<p data-start="2804" data-end="2826">Kim‚Äôs curvature tensor</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>affect</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mtext>‚Äâ</mtext><mi>Œº</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>œï</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>‚Äâ</mtext><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{ij}^{(\text{affect})} = m\,\mu(\phi)\,R_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.4578em; vertical-align: -0.413em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.0448em;"><span style="top: -2.4231em; margin-left: -0.0715em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05724em;">ij</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3.2198em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mopen mtight">(</span><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">affect</span></span><span class="mclose mtight">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.413em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.0361em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">m</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">Œº</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">œï</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05724em;">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="2881" data-end="2962">mirrors your curvature of the plenum metric generated by scalar‚Äìentropy coupling:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>RSVP</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>‚àº</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àÇ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àÇ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Œ¶</mi><mo>‚àí</mo><mi>Œª</mi><mtext>‚Äâ</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àÇ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àÇ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{ij}^{(\text{RSVP})} \sim \partial_i \partial_j \Phi - \lambda\,(\partial_i S)(\partial_j S).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.4578em; vertical-align: -0.413em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.0448em;"><span style="top: -2.4231em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05724em;">ij</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3.2198em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mopen mtight">(</span><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">RSVP</span></span><span class="mclose mtight">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.413em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">‚àº</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9805em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right: 0.05556em;">‚àÇ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0556em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right: 0.05556em;">‚àÇ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0556em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05724em;">j</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">Œ¶</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">‚àí</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.0361em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">Œª</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right: 0.05556em;">‚àÇ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0556em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord" style="margin-right: 0.05556em;">‚àÇ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0556em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05724em;">j</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="3065" data-end="3334">In both, meaning or affect (<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">m</span></span></span></span>, <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>Œº</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">Œº</span></span></span></span>) modulates curvature strength, bending the manifold of inference (ERI) or spacetime (RSVP).<br data-start="3199" data-end="3202">
The <em data-start="3206" data-end="3227">affective curvature</em> in ERI can thus be reinterpreted as an <em data-start="3267" data-end="3295">informational Ricci scalar</em> derived from RSVP‚Äôs entropic geometry:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>affect</mtext></msub><mtext>‚ÄÖ‚Ää</mtext><mo>‚Üî</mo><mtext>‚ÄÖ‚Ää</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">Œ¶</mi><mtext>‚Äâ</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àá</mi><mi>S</mi><msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\text{affect}} \;\leftrightarrow\; \Phi\,(\nabla S)^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0715em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">affect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">‚Üî</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.1141em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">Œ¶</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">‚àá</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span><span class="mclose"><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8641em;"><span style="top: -3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="3399" data-end="3563">This provides a geometric interpretation of emotional intensity as field curvature‚Äîa literal ‚Äúbending of experiential space‚Äù consistent with your Plenum hypothesis.</p>
<hr data-start="3565" data-end="3568">
<h2 data-start="3570" data-end="3624">4. Spiral Growth and RSVP‚Äôs Recursive Entropy Loops</h2>
<p data-start="3626" data-end="3653">ERI‚Äôs <strong data-start="3632" data-end="3653">spiral trajectory</strong></p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">Œ∏</mi><mo>Àô</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>‚àí</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àá</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">Œ©</mi><mo>√ó</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àá</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dot{\bm{\theta}} = -\nabla F + \boldsymbol{\Omega}\times\nabla F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9313em;"></span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.9313em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol" style="margin-right: 0.03194em;">Œ∏</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3.2634em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.1389em;"><span class="mord">Àô</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7667em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">‚àí</span><span class="mord">‚àá</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">F</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7694em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathbf">Œ©</span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">√ó</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">‚àá</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">F</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="3726" data-end="3775">mirrors RSVP‚Äôs recursive scalar‚Äìvector evolution:</p>
