<p data-start="3871" data-end="4182">The Helmholtz decomposition in ERI corresponds exactly to your split between <em data-start="3948" data-end="3973">negentropic dissipation</em> (divergence flow) and <em data-start="3996" data-end="4015">semantic rotation</em> (vorticity).<br data-start="4028" data-end="4031">
The spiral trajectory in ERI‚Äôs belief manifold equates to RSVP‚Äôs ‚Äúfall of space‚Äù through successive entropic re-alignments‚Äîgrowth by cyclic relaxation.</p>
<p data-start="4184" data-end="4211">This gives a formal bridge:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ERI:&nbsp;</mtext><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">Œ∏</mi><mo>Àô</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>‚àí</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àá</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Œ©</mi><mo>√ó</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àá</mi><mi>F</mi><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mo>‚ü∫</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mtext>RSVP:&nbsp;</mtext><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">Œ¶</mi><mo>Àô</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>‚àí</mo><mi>Œ±</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àá</mi><mo>‚ãÖ</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Œ≤</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mo>√ó</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àá</mi><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{ERI: } \dot{\bm{\theta}} = -\nabla F + \Omega\times\nabla F
\quad\Longleftrightarrow\quad
\text{RSVP: } \dot\Phi = -\alpha\nabla\cdot\mathbf{v} + \beta(\mathbf{v}\times\nabla S).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9313em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">ERI:&nbsp;</span></span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.9313em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol" style="margin-right: 0.03194em;">Œ∏</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3.2634em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.1389em;"><span class="mord">Àô</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7667em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">‚àí</span><span class="mord">‚àá</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">F</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7667em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">Œ©</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">√ó</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7073em; vertical-align: -0.024em;"></span><span class="mord">‚àá</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">F</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">‚ü∫</span><span cla