<p data-start="6627" data-end="6940">Thus emotional resonance in ERI corresponds to a <em data-start="6676" data-end="6706">phase-dependent perturbation</em> of RSVP‚Äôs metric tensor, producing local geometric deformation‚Äîessentially ‚Äúaffective gravity‚Äù in the plenum.<br data-start="6816" data-end="6819">
This gives you a path to formalize <strong data-start="6854" data-end="6878">Affective Relativity</strong>: subjective experience as curvature of inferential spacetime.</p>
