</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{align}
(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\cdot</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v})</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{i,j,k}
 </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span>= </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\frac</span></span><span>{v</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>x(i</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span>+</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span>1,j,k)-v</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>x(i</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span>-</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span>1,j,k)}{2h}
  + </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\frac</span></span><span>{v</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>y(i,j</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span>+</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span>1,k)-v</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>y(i,j</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span>-</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span>1,k)}{2h}
  + </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\frac</span></span><span>{v</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>z(i,j,k</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span>+</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span>1)-v</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>z(i,j,k</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span>-</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span>1)}{2h},</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>[4pt]
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2 S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{i,j,k}
 </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span>= </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\frac</span></span><span>{1}{h</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\sum</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\hat</span></span><span> n</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\in</span></span><span> N(i,j,k)}(S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\hat</span></span><span> n}-S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{i,j,k}),
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{align}
where </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>N(i,j,k)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> are the six nearest neighbours.
Integrate in time using a second-order Runge‚ÄìKutta (Heun) method:
