 +</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\tfrac</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Delta</span></span><span> t}{2}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\big</span></span><span>(
   </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\dot</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v}}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>{(1)}+</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\dot</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v}}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>{(2)}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\big</span></span><span>),</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>{n+1} </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span>= S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>{n}
 +</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\tfrac</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Delta</span></span><span> t}{2}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\big</span></span><span>(
   </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\dot</span></span><span> S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>{(1)}+</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\dot</span></span><span> S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>{(2)}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\big</span></span><span>).
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{align}
At each step compute local resonance
