and update the phase variable
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\leftarrow</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\phi</span></span><span>+</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\omega</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Delta</span></span><span> t</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>,
with </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\omega</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> drawn from a narrow band of frequencies to simulate
affective variability.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>*{A.4‚ÄÉBoundary and Normalization Conditions}
Adopt periodic boundaries to preserve global energy.
