</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\leftarrow</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span>/</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>2,</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\qquad</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\leftarrow</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v}/</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>2,</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\qquad</span></span><span>
S</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\leftarrow</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span>S/S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\max</span></span><span>}.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\]</span></span><span>
The total rhythmic energy functional is conserved to first order:
