</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>*{A.5‚ÄÉObservable Quantities}
Key diagnostics for simulation analysis include:
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{itemize}[leftmargin=1.2em]
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{Resonance Amplitude:}
