- $K$ = coupling strength (resonance gain)

**Bridging Equation 2: Phase Alignment from Field Coupling**

The phase $\theta_i$ emerges from the RSVP field evolution. Define:

$$\theta_i(t) = \arg\left[\Phi_i(t) + i \|\mathbf{v}_i(t)\|\right]$$

This treats the symbolic-affective state as a **complex amplitude** where:
