**Optimal resonance occurs when:**

$$\boxed{0 &lt; |\delta\phi_{ua}| &lt; \delta\phi_{\text{crit}} \approx \frac{\pi}{4}}$$

Too aligned ($\delta\phi \to 0$): no novelty, stagnation  
