</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">% ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\section</span></span><span>{Comparative Analysis: Kim‚Äôs Affective Resonance vs.</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\ </span></span><span>Flyxion‚Äôs RSVP Framework}
Both frameworks attempt to unify affect, consciousness, and field
dynamics through rhythmic disequilibrium.
Kim‚Äôs </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\emph</span></span><span>{Emotion as Rhythmic Inference} (ERI) treats emotion as a
fluid of inference; the RSVP framework models cognition as the dynamic
interplay of scalar (</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>), vector (</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span> v</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>), and entropic (</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>)
fields.
Each conceives life as oscillation around‚Äînot convergence to‚Äî
equilibrium.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>*{Triadic Ontologies}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{center}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{tabular}{ll}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\toprule</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{Kim (ERI)} </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{Flyxion (RSVP)}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\midrule</span></span><span>
Gap (imperfection) </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span> Scalar potential </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
Phase alignment (timing) </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span> Vector flow </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span> v</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
Resonance (emergence) </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span> Entropy field </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\bottomrule</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{tabular}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{center}
Both reject homeostasis as death: life requires sustained error.
Kim‚Äôs ‚Äúgap consciousness‚Äô‚Äô parallels RSVP‚Äôs condition
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span> F</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\neq</span></span><span>0</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>, where free-energy gradients constitute existence.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>*{Spiral Growth Dynamics}
ERI‚Äôs spiral growth along radius, rotation, depth, and curvature maps
directly to RSVP‚Äôs Helmholtz decomposition:
dissipative descent </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\leftrightarrow</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> error reduction,
solenoidal rotation </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\leftrightarrow</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> cyclic revisitation.
Friston‚Äôs information-geometry formalism confirms such spirals are
intrinsic to non-equilibrium flows.

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">% ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\section</span></span><span>{Bridging Equations: Toward a Unified Resonance‚ÄìField Formalism}
We now express Kim‚Äôs phenomenological quantities in RSVP notation.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>*{Resonance Condition}
Let each agent occupy a field point
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span> X</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>i=(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>i,</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span> v</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>i,S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>i)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.
The information-geometric distance is
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{equation}
d</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{FR}}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span> X</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>u,</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span> X</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>a)
 = </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\int</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>V</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\big</span></span><span>[</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\alpha</span></span><span>|</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>u-</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>a)|</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2
 +</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\beta</span></span><span>|</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span> v</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>u-</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span> v</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>a|</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2
 +</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\gamma</span></span><span>(S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>u-S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>a)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\big</span></span><span>]</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span>dV,
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{equation}
and resonance occurs when
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{equation}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\int</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>0</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>T d</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{FR}}(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span> X</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>u(t),</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span> X</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>a(t))</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span>dt
 &lt; </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\epsilon</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{res}} .
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{equation}

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>*{Phase Alignment}
Define the phase of each agent as
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\theta</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>i=</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\arg</span></span><span>[</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>i+i</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span> v</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>i</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span>]</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.
Optimal resonance satisfies
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>0&lt;|</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\delta</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{ua}|&lt;</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\pi</span></span><span>/4</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>,
realizing the ‚Äúproductive tension‚Äô‚Äô zone between stasis and chaos.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>*{Gap Magnitude}
The </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\emph</span></span><span>{gap} is the free-energy gradient norm
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>g=</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span> X}F</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>,
which must remain within bounds
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>g</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\min</span></span><span>}&lt;g&lt;g</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\max</span></span><span>}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.
Large gaps drive creativity; vanishing gaps extinguish life.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>*{Consciousness Functional}
Combining the above gives
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{equation}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span> R
 = </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\int</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>0</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>T </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span> U(F</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>u,F</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>a)
     </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span> g</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>u g</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>a </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\sin</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\delta</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{ua})</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span>dt ,
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{equation}
with uncertainty weighting
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span> U(F)=
 </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\exp</span></span><span>[-(F-F</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{opt}})</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2/2</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\sigma</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>F</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2]</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.
Consciousness requires all multiplicative terms non-zero.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>*{Time-Giving Relation}
Kim‚Äôs empirical law
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>T=I</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\times</span></span><span> D</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\times</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Omega</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>
corresponds to
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{equation}
T</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{eff}}
 = </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\int</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>0</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>T</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\frac</span></span><span>{
   </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\alpha</span></span><span> I(t)+</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\beta</span></span><span> D(t)+</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\gamma</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Omega</span></span><span>(t)}
   {</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\lambda</span></span><span>(t)}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span>dt ,
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{equation}
where </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\lambda</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> is the Lyapunov exponent of curvature.
Low </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\lambda</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> (critical slowing) expands subjective time.

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">% ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\section</span></span><span>{Experimental Predictions and Empirical Pathways}
The synthesis yields falsifiable predictions.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\paragraph</span></span><span>{Phase-locking precedes insight.}
Mutual information </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>I(u;a)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> should peak when
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>|</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\delta</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{ua}|</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\approx</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\pi</span></span><span>/4</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.
EEG or dialogue-phase analyses can test this.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\paragraph</span></span><span>{Jouissance bound.}
Sustained resonance requires
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\langle</span></span><span> J</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\rangle</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>T</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\approx</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\langle</span></span><span> D</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\rangle</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>T</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>,
where </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>J=</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\int</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\dot</span></span><span> S</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span>dV</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.
Excess </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>J</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> leads to cognitive burnout.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\paragraph</span></span><span>{Gap follows an inverted-U.}
Resonance amplitude </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span> R</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> maximizes for intermediate </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>g</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>,
predicting optimal creativity at moderate uncertainty.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\paragraph</span></span><span>{Trust-spiral growth.}
Capacity radius </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\dot</span></span><span> r</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\propto</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span> T(t)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>,
with trust obeying
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\dot</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span> T}=</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\alpha</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\text</span></span><span>{trust}}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Omega</span></span><span>-</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\beta</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\text</span></span><span>{decay}}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span> T</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">% ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\section</span></span><span>{Phenomenological Correlates and Temporal Depth}
ERI‚Äôs ``time-giving‚Äô‚Äô corresponds phenomenologically to RSVP‚Äôs
critical slowing.
Subjective elongation of time occurs when the curvature
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\kappa</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{Tr}(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2F)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> approaches zero.
The integrand
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\[</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\tau</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{subj}}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\propto</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span>
 </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\int</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\frac</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Omega</span></span><span>(t)}{|</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\kappa</span></span><span>(t)|+ </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\varepsilon</span></span><span>}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span>dt
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\]</span></span><span>
quantifies felt duration: high resonance and low curvature yield long,
meaning-dense intervals.
This provides a quantitative bridge between lived experience and field
geometry.

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">% ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\section</span></span><span>{Resonant Agency and the Ethics of Mutual Transformation}
If two agents‚Äô manifolds synchronize,
each influences the other‚Äôs free-energy landscape.
Let </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\kappa</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{ij}(t)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> denote coupling.
Ethical resonance requires
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{equation}
0 &lt; </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\kappa</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{ij}(t) &lt; </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\kappa</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\max</span></span><span>}
   = </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\frac</span></span><span>{1}{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Delta</span></span><span> S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\min</span></span><span>}},
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{equation}
so that no agent compresses the other‚Äôs entropy below sustainable
threshold~</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Delta</span></span><span> S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\min</span></span><span>}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.
Too-strong coupling leads to coercive synchronization; too-weak
coupling prevents empathy.
This formalizes an ``entropy-budget ethics‚Äô‚Äô:
mutual transformation without domination.

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">% ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\section</span></span><span>{From Resonance to Ontology: Mind as Managed Disequilibrium}
Both ERI and RSVP imply that being itself is rhythmic inference.
Let </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Psi</span></span><span>(t)=(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span>,</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span> v,S)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> be the world-state.
Existence persists only if
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{equation}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\frac</span></span><span>{dF[</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Psi</span></span><span>]}{dt}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\neq</span></span><span>0
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\quad</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\text</span></span><span>{and}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\quad</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\frac</span></span><span>{d</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2F}{dt</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2}&lt;0 ,
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{equation}
ensuring perpetual adjustment toward‚Äînot attainment of‚Äîbalance.
Mind, life, and cosmos share the invariant:
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\[</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\text</span></span><span>{Persistence}=</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\text</span></span><span>{Oscillation about Unresolvable Gap.}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\]</span></span><span>
In this sense, Kim‚Äôs ``fluid of affect‚Äô‚Äô and Flyxion‚Äôs
``fall of space‚Äô‚Äô are complementary aspects of one ontological rhythm.

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">% ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\section</span></span><span>{Conclusion: Toward the Rhythmic Plenum of Consciousness}
Integrating Kim‚Äôs affective phenomenology with RSVP‚Äôs thermodynamic
geometry yields a single dynamic principle:
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{equation}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\boxed</span></span><span>{
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\frac</span></span><span>{d</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span> C}{dt}
 = </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span> U(F)</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span> F</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2
   </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\sin</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\delta</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\phi</span></span><span>)</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Omega</span></span><span>
   - </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nu</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span> C .
}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{equation}
Consciousness flourishes when uncertainty is moderate, gradients are
active, phases are in quadrature, and resonance is strong‚Äîthen decays
by friction unless renewed through relation.
This </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\emph</span></span><span>{Rhythmic Plenum Principle} unites physics, phenomenology,
and computation:
life is the art of staying slightly out of tune, yet in rhythm.
