> provides a rigorous field-theoretic foundation that aligns closely with the conceptual and mathematical language of Juyoung Kim‚Äôs <em data-start="254" data-end="287">‚ÄúEmotion as Rhythmic Inference‚Äù</em> talk.</p>
<p data-start="297" data-end="925">At its core, the paper formalizes <em data-start="331" data-end="339">desire</em> as an oscillatory, non-equilibrium curvature of entropic flow within a coupled scalar‚Äìvector‚Äìentropy system‚Äîexplicitly the <strong data-start="463" data-end="507">Relativistic Scalar-Vector Plenum (RSVP)</strong>.  The framework interprets persistence (both cosmological and cognitive) as rhythmic disequilibrium sustained through recursive deviations from zero free-energy curvature.  In this sense, <em data-start="696" data-end="705">emotion</em> in Kim‚Äôs terms corresponds to <em data-start="736" data-end="748">jouissance</em> in RSVP: the energetic surplus that maintains oscillation between symbolic order and entropic renewal<span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="relative inline-flex items-center"><button class="ms-1 flex h-[25px] text-[10px] leading-[13px] rounded-xl items-center justify-center gap-1 px-2 relative text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" alt="File" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M11.2598 2.25191C11.8396 2.25191 12.2381 2.24808 12.6201 2.33981L12.8594 2.40719C13.0957 2.48399 13.3228 2.5886 13.5352 2.71871L13.6582 2.79879C13.9416 2.99641 14.1998 3.25938 14.5586 3.61813L15.5488 4.60836L15.833 4.89449C16.0955 5.16136 16.2943 5.38072 16.4482 5.6318L16.5703 5.84957C16.6829 6.07074 16.7691 6.30495 16.8271 6.54684L16.8574 6.69137C16.918 7.0314 16.915 7.39998 16.915 7.90719V13.0839C16.915 13.7728 16.9157 14.3301 16.8789 14.7802C16.8461 15.1808 16.781 15.5417 16.6367 15.8779L16.5703 16.0205C16.3049 16.5413 15.9008 16.9772 15.4053 17.2812L15.1865 17.4033C14.8099 17.5951 14.4041 17.6745 13.9463 17.7119C13.49