<li data-start="4065" data-end="4225">
<p data-start="4068" data-end="4225"><strong data-start="4068" data-end="4104">Phenomenology of the Limit Cycle</strong> ‚Äî Interpret Kim‚Äôs ‚Äúfelt flow‚Äù as traversal of RSVP‚Äôs limit-cycle attractor: the physics of desire as rhythmic inference.</p>
</li>
