Toward a Unified Mathematical Framework for Affective Resonance}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\author</span></span><span>{Flyxion}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\date</span></span><span>{November 2025}

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">% ---------- Document ----------</span></span><span>
