</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{Theoretical.} Derive Fisher‚ÄìRao metrics from </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>F[</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span>,</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span> v,S]</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>; analyze bifurcations and topological invariants of limit cycles </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\citep</span></span><span>{ramstead2022active}.</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{Ethical.} Formalize entropy budgets for safe human‚ÄìAI coupling in embodied settings </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\citep</span></span><span>{varela1991embodied}.

