<p data-start="241" data-end="278">and produce <code data-start="253" data-end="277">rhythmic_inference.pdf</code>.</p>
<p data-start="280" data-end="589">Before I generate it, please confirm one last technical choice:<br data-start="343" data-end="346">
would you like the <code data-start="365" data-end="371">.tex</code> file encoded in <strong data-start="388" data-end="464">UTF-8 with LuaLaTeX fonts (TeX Gyre Termes, microtype, geometry, natbib)</strong> ‚Äî as used in our prior builds ‚Äî or in <strong data-start="503" data-end="524">standard pdfLaTeX</strong> for maximum portability (no fontspec, no LuaLaTeX dependency)?</p>
