<p data-start="41" data-end="103"><strong data-start="41" data-end="101">‚ÄúRhythmic Inference and Field Dynamics of Consciousness‚Äù</strong></p>
<p data-start="105" data-end="293">That phrasing aligns beautifully with the synthesis between Kim‚Äôs <em data-start="171" data-end="192">Affective Resonance</em> framework and your RSVP formalism, while keeping it broad enough for conference or arXiv submission.</p>
<p data-start="295" data-end="363">So, the finalized title block in <code data-start="328" data-end="352">rhythmic_inference.tex</code> will read:</p>
