<h4 data-start="3307" data-end="3348"><strong data-start="3312" data-end="3348">Section 9 ‚Äî Concluding Synthesis</strong></h4>
<p data-start="3350" data-end="3488">Rhythmic Inference, when viewed through the <em data-start="3394" data-end="3423">Epistemic Energy Functional</em>, constitutes a special case of the <strong data-start="3459" data-end="3487">Reflective Rigour Regime</strong>:</p>
